    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d345-a2">

                <pb facs="0465" n="359" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg359"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 1227.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to the
                            diplomatic corps</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-01-07"><hi rendition="#italic">January 7,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Col. Denby has the honor to present his compliments to his colleagues and to
                    circulate for their information and approval a memorandum of the action taken by
                    the members of the diplomatic body who were present at the American legation
                    Tuesday, January 6, 1891.</p>
                <p>Col Denby avails himself of this opportunity to renew to his colleagues the
                    assurance of his highest consideration.</p>
                <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">M. von Brandt</hi>.</p>
                <p>His Excellency Sir <hi rendition="#small-caps">John Walsham</hi>.</p>
                <p>His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">M. Otori</hi>.</p>
                <p>His Excellency M. le Chevalier <hi rendition="#small-caps">Pansa</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">M. Ferguson</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">M. de Uribari</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">M. Kleimenow</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">M. Ristelhueber</hi>.</p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">M. Michel</hi>.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
